/**
 * Real cigar catalog: well-known brands, lines, and vitolas that make up the
 * bulk of what sits in US humidors. Facts only (blend, sizes, origin); the
 * one-line descriptions are our own words. MSRP is an approximate US single
 * price and is only used to pre-fill store inventory forms.
 *
 * seedCatalog() is idempotent: it inserts any (brand, name) not already in
 * the cigars table and leaves existing rows untouched, so it is safe to run
 * on every boot. Run standalone with: node src/database/catalog.js
 */
